    "body": "I don't have a strong opinion here, but it seemed like we could allow specification authors the flexibility to not bother with the invalid value state if the intent is that it reflect as null.  (I think this is a behavior change only in the sense that it allows specification authors to write spec text in ways that they couldn't before, not that it would change the implementation behavior of any previously-conformant spec text.  At least that was my intent.)",
